  "published": "2026-06-18T12:00:09.397Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Added a Roslyn analyzer (ODOO001-ODOO006) that validates [OdooModel]/[OdooField] usage at\n            compile time: models with no fields, empty model/field names, duplicate field names, readable\n            fields without a setter, writable fields without a getter, and readable models without a\n            public parameterless constructor.\n            Added a source generator that emits a compile-time OdooModelBinding for each well-formed\n            [OdooModel] type, replacing the reflection used to build metadata and to read/write property\n            values (init-only properties are assigned via [UnsafeAccessor]). Models the generator cannot\n            safely emit fall back to the existing reflection path, so behavior is unchanged.\n            The analyzer and generator ship under analyzers/dotnet/cs and require no configuration. The\n            generated mapping path is reflection-free; full NativeAOT/trim annotation of the reflection\n            fallback remains a future enhancement.",
